   "tender": {
    "id": "CF-2270200D0O000000rwimUAA",
    "title": "Technical Support and Implementation services to the NHS",
    "description": "This is a call off contract via the HSSF framework for technical support and implementation services to the NHSE National Team,  Integrated Care Boards (ICBs) and NHS Trusts in England to implement the Federated Data Platform (FDP) software. \r\n\r\nThe Supplier will support the NHSE Data Services team to not only build the Federated Data Platform (FDP) capability, but enhance the Data Service functions, platforms and integrating services to support the transformation change. \r\n\r\nThe Supplier will support ICBs and Trusts in implementing their individual federated platforms, which will in turn \r\nfeed into the national model.\r\n\r\nThe maximum value of this contract will be £8,500,000.",
